Immediate fail conditions:

- Numbness.
- Tingling.
- Cold fingers.
- Discoloration.
- Hand weakness.
- Wrist pain.
- Sharp pressure.
- Reduced finger motion.
- Loss of grip strength.
- Quick release unreachable.
- Glove or wrist assembly trapped by cuff.
- Cable crossing palm, grip path, wrist bones, or inner elbow.

