## G. HANDOFF

Completed Stage 17 decisions:

- FR-017 cuffs are pilot-interface components only.
- Left and right cuffs are separate patterns.
- Upper straps sit below the elbow crease.
- Lower straps sit above the wrist bones and wrist crease.
- Inner forearm is a no-pressure/no-hardware/no-cable route.
- Outer forearm is the only provisional alignment/cable/sensor zone.
- Quick releases stay visible and reachable, not hidden by frame or armor.
- Sensors are placeholders only.
- Cable routing stays on the outer forearm and avoids inner elbow, wrist bones, palm, and grip path.
- First prototype is limited to non-powered fit and interface mockup testing.

